ragraph [ref=f1e429]: Continue the current phase and gather one more representative coach-reviewed set.\n        - generic [ref=f1e430]:\n          - text: Remaining opportunity\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e431]: Test the decision under an ordinary target constraint without adding speed.\n        - generic [ref=f1e432]:\n          - text: Coach recommendation\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e433]: Continue the documented bounded practice and use the stop-or-ask rule.\n      - article [ref=f1e434]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e435]:\n          - text: Coach-recommended next option\n          - heading \"Long-form four-session development and review phase Long-form four-session development and review phase\" [level=3] [ref=f1e436]\n          - strong [ref=f1e437]: CAD 480.00\n        - generic [ref=f1e438]:\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e439]: A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action