 service confirms it.\n  - contentinfo [ref=f1e459]:\n    - generic [ref=f1e460]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e461]: CL\n      - generic [ref=f1e462]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e463]: Foothills Long-Form Independent Golf Coaching Studio Foothills Long-Form Independent Golf Coaching Studio\n        - generic [ref=f1e464]: Coach-authored private development plan\n    - generic [ref=f1e465]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e466]: Updated Aug 11, 2026\n      - generic [ref=f1e467]: Access expires Aug 11, 2026"}}
