e strike location as the immediate feedback signal. Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal.\n              - generic [ref=f1e383]: \"Status: Completed\"\n          - listitem [ref=f1e384]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e386]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e387]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e388]: Launch-monitor session\n                - time [ref=f1e389]: Jul 14, 2026\n              - heading \"Synthetic baseline vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron\" [level=3] [ref=f1e390]\n              - paragraph [ref=f1e391]: Use the selected values only as bounded context for the coach-authored current priority.\n              - generic [ref=f1e392]: \"Status: Limited\"\n    - generic [ref=f1e393]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e394]:\n        - text: Phase review\n        - heading \"What changed, what remains uncertain, and what happens next?\" [level=2] [ref=f1e395]\n      - generic [ref=f1e396]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e397]: The selected current sample was more predictable while the broader transfer question remains open.\n        - generic [ref=f1e398]:\n          - text: Original phase purpose\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e399]: Create a stable strike window at a comfortable, representative tempo.\n        - generic [ref=f1e400]:\n          - text: Evidence considered\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e401]: The synthetic golfer completed a lesson, assigned practice, and two manual launch-monitor summaries.\n        - generic [ref=f1e402]:\n          - text: Exact selected source records\n          - list [ref=f1e403]:\n            - listitem [ref=f1e404]:\n              - strong [ref=f1e405]: Lesson\n              - text: \": Planned representative-transfer lesson with a deliberately descriptive synthetic title\"\n              - generic [ref=f1e406]: · reviewed at roadmap revision 12\n              - paragraph [ref=f1e407]: The selected synthetic sample showed a wider strike window when transition tempo increased.\n              - list [ref=f1e408]:\n                - listitem [ref=f1e409]: \"Evidence: Selected launch-monitor comparison context (comparison)\"\n                - listitem [ref=f1e410]: \"Measurement session: Synthetic baseline vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · 2026-07-14\"\n                - listitem [ref=f1e411]: \"Measurement session: Synthetic current vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · 2026-08-04\"\n            - listitem [ref=f1e412]:\n              - strong [ref=f1e413]: Practice\n              - text: \": Editable representative centered-contact window with complete synthetic guidance\"\n            - listitem [ref=f1e414]:\n              - strong [ref=f1e415]: Launch Session\n              - text: \": Synthetic baseline vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · 2026-07-14\"\n            - listitem [ref=f1e416]:\n              - strong [ref=f1e417]: Launch Session\n              - text: \": Synthetic current vendor-neutral manual entry · Synthetic 7 iron · 2026-08-04\"\n            - listitem [ref=f1e418]:\n              - strong [ref=f1e419]: Launch Comparison\n              - text: \": Selected synthetic baseline and current values\"\n            - listitem [ref=f1e420]:\n              - strong [ref=f1e421]: Evidence\n              - text: \": Selected launch-monitor comparison context\"\n        - generic [ref=f1e422]:\n          - text: Reliability\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e423]: Early indication in bounded synthetic evidence\n        - generic [ref=f1e424]:\n          - text: What remains uncertain\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e425]: No real golfer, automated swing analysis, on-course outcome, or durable coaching result is represented.\n        - generic [ref=f1e426]:\n          - text: Golfer contribution\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e427]: The synthetic golfer reported that the reset made the target decision easier to repeat.\n        - generic [ref=f1e428]:\n          - text: Coach conclusion\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e429]: Continue the current phase and gather one more representative coach-reviewed set.\n        - generic [ref=f1e430]:\n          - text: Remaining opportunity\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e431]: Test the decision under an ordinary target constraint without adding speed.\n        - generic [ref=f1e432]:\n          - text: Coach recommendation\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e433]: Continue the documented bounded practice and use the stop-or-ask rule.\n      - article [ref=f1e434]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e435]:\n          - text: Coach-recommended next option\n          - heading \"Long-form four-session development and review phase Long-form four-session development and review phase\" [level=3] [ref=f1e436]\n          - strong [ref=f1e437]: CAD 480.00\n        - generic [ref=f1e438]:\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e439]: A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries. A deliberately detailed synthetic package description used to inspect wrapping, hierarchy, and clear external-action boundaries.\n          - generic [ref=f1e440]:\n            - strong [ref=f1e441]: What is included\n            - list [ref=f1e442]:\n              - listitem [ref=f1e443]: Four private lessons\n              - listitem [ref=f1e444]: Coach-authored practice direction\n          - generic [ref=f1e445]: Synthetic QA package. Confirm current terms with the coach.\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e446]: You will leave Roadmap. Booking or payment happens on the coach's external service and is not complete until that service confirms it.\n      - generic [ref=f1e447]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e448]:\n          - text: Choose without pressure\n          - heading \"What would you like to do next?\" [level=3] [ref=f1e449]\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e450]: Roadmap records only the choice below for Coach Longcontent roadmap to review. It does not send a message or treat an external visit as a sale.\n        - generic [ref=f1e451]:\n          - link \"Continue to the coach’s external page\" [ref=f1e452] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: https://booking.example.ca/functional-qa\n          - button \"Ask Coach Longcontent roadmap a question\" [ref=f1e453] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Review later\" [ref=f1e454] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Request reassessment\" [ref=f1e455] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Practise independently\" [ref=f1e456] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Not pursuing this option\" [ref=f1e457] [cursor=pointer]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e458]: This link always opens the coach's external service. Roadmap makes a best-effort record that you opened it, but a tracking or network failure will not block the handoff. Booking or payment is complete only when the external service confirms it.\n  - contentinfo [ref=f1e459]:\n    - generic [ref=f1e460]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e461]: CL\n      - generic [ref=f1e462]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e463]: Foothills Long-Form Independent Golf Coaching Studio Foothills Long-Form Independent Golf Coaching Studio\n        - generic [ref=f1e464]: Coach-authored private development plan\n    - generic [ref=f1e465]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e466]: Updated Aug 11, 2026\n      - generic [ref=f1e467]: Access expires Aug 11, 2026"}}
